{
  "declaredLength": 1404,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "时刻提供最优质的服务……\n欢迎光临鼎极餐馆。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65F6523B63D04F9B67004F188D287684670D52A120262026000A6B228FCE51494E349F0E67819910998630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请来挑战顶级全餐。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF767656311621898767EA751689910300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不愧是鼎极，\n果真是顶级。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D6127662F9F0E6781FF0C000A679C771F662F98767EA730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太庆幸我能\n享受到这份味道了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A5E865E78621180FD000A4EAB53D752308FD94EFD547390534E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望你能得出好的结论。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B4F6080FD5F9751FA597D76847ED38BBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "肚子饿会让人做出错误的判断，\n得用最棒的美食填饱肚子才行。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "809A5B50997F4F1A8BA94EBA505A51FA95198BEF7684522465ADFF0C000A5F977528670068D276847F8E98DF586B9971809A5B50624D884C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战的世界\n可没有什么是绝对的哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF9621876844E16754C000A53EF6CA167094EC04E48662F7EDD5BF9768454E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战时的姐姐和\n宝可梦超帅的哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF9621865F6768459D059D0548C000A5B9D53EF68A68D855E05768454E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只靠当一名宝可梦训练家，\n真的能过得下去吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA97605F534E00540D5B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A771F768480FD8FC75F974E0B53BB5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我支持姐姐哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211652F630159D059D054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我公司里有个讨厌鬼，\n真想在宝可梦对战中打飞那个人。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211516C53F891CC67094E2A8BA8538C9B3CFF0C000A771F60F357285B9D53EF68A65BF962184E2D625398DE90A34E2A4EBA30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯嗯是这样啊，\n嗯嗯我懂你哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55EF662F8FD96837554AFF0C000A55EF55EF621161C24F6054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“奶油烤布蕾～极致～”\n实在太过顶级……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C59766CB970E45E03857EFF5E678181F4FF5E201D000A5B9E5728592A8FC798767EA7202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "简直是至高无上的焦糖化反应！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B8076F4662F81F39AD865E04E0A768471267CD6531653CD5E94FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聚集了宝可梦训练家和\n美食家的店还真是厉害啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "805A96C64E865B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6548C000A7F8E98DF5BB676845E978FD8771F662F53895BB3554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里是老板克里斯托福为了在宝可梦对战\n与饮食两方面都能登峰造极而经营的地方。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n……冷静想想还真是不知所云啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CC662F8001677F514B91CC65AF6258798F4E3A4E8657285B9D53EF68A65BF96218000A4E0E996E98DF4E2465B9976290FD80FD767B5CF090206781800C7ECF84257684573065B9300200100001BE00000A2026202651B7975960F360F38FD8771F662F4E0D77E562404E91554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本店每道菜肴都有\n最佳的品尝时机。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C5E976BCF905383DC80B490FD6709000A67004F73768454C15C1D65F6673A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用完餐之后来打宝可梦对战，\n这样可以吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75285B8C99104E4B540E676562535B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0C000A8FD9683753EF4EE55417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟想互相理解的话，\n来场对战是最好的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF60F34E9276F8740689E376848BDDFF0C000A6765573A5BF96218662F6700597D768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为能吃上只提供给贵宾的甜品，\n我锻炼了我的搭档哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A80FD54034E0A53EA63D04F9B7ED98D355BBE7684751C54C1FF0C000A6211953B70BC4E8662117684642D686354E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为我努力过头了，\n所以要给自己奖励。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A621152AA529B8FC759344E86FF0C000A62404EE589817ED981EA5DF1595652B130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我满脑子都是关于\n员工餐的事。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116EE181115B5090FD662F51734E8E000A54585DE5991076844E8B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "从年轻时就接触真材实料的东西是很重要的。\n你不用客气，尽管吃吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECE5E748F7B65F65C3163A589E6771F67505B9E659976844E1C897F662F5F8891CD898176843002000A4F604E0D75285BA26C14FF0C5C3D7BA15403542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃饭最重要是看和谁吃哦。\n只要不是难吃的店，哪里都没问题。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403996D670091CD8981662F770B548C8C01540354E63002000A53EA89814E0D662F96BE540376845E97FF0C54EA91CC90FD6CA195EE989830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一旦知道了鼎极的味道，\n就无法在别的店感到满足了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0065E677E590534E869F0E6781768454739053FF0C000A5C3165E06CD55728522B76845E97611F52306EE18DB34E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道鼎极的味道之后，\n就能理解其他地方的餐点是什么水平了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590539F0E67817684547390534E4B540EFF0C000A5C3180FD740689E351764ED6573065B97684991070B9662F4EC04E486C345E734E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    }
